WEBVTT

01:31.320 --> 01:35.280
EPISODE 6: THE GREAT TOMBIFICATION

01:42.900 --> 01:46.010
Now, that was uncalled for,
Ogawara Taisei-san.

01:46.010 --> 01:48.290
Using your dominance on a person?

01:48.290 --> 01:50.840
Oh? You're better than I expected.

01:51.310 --> 01:54.000
You know how to handle relics, too.

01:54.000 --> 01:56.500
And your movements are impressive...

02:00.510 --> 02:02.080
but you're no match for me!

02:07.820 --> 02:10.260
Wh-What? How can this be?

02:10.260 --> 02:14.320
Why would my relic's power just 
disappear while I'm using it?

02:14.320 --> 02:15.820
You didn't notice?

02:16.320 --> 02:18.220
Aren't these what you're looking for?

02:19.240 --> 02:22.100
Wh-When did you...

02:23.320 --> 02:28.350
<i>The one thing you used to praise 
me for was my pickpocketing skill.</i>

02:31.340 --> 02:34.550
THE LONELY GOD'S INVITATION
(GRADE SS - GOD GRADE - CONSUMABLE RELIC)
USES: (43/50)

02:31.650 --> 02:33.340
<i>God Grade, huh?</i>

02:33.340 --> 02:36.370
<i>Too bad. My dominance 
isn't enough for that yet.</i>

02:34.680 --> 02:37.850
GOD GRADE

02:38.550 --> 02:43.850
Well, this has been most entertaining.
You all clearly have a death wish.

02:47.350 --> 02:51.530
<i>With the Relic of Conquest,
he can control his enemies.</i>

02:51.530 --> 02:53.360
<i>Is he seriously planning to use it?</i>

02:55.360 --> 03:00.720
<i>It's a parasitic relic just like Irene's, 
so I can't tell where he's keeping it.</i>

03:00.720 --> 03:05.110
<i>And on top of that,
he's wearing an armor relic,</i>

03:05.110 --> 03:07.530
<i>essentially making him 
an impregnable fortress.</i>

03:12.380 --> 03:16.880
Not exactly subtle. Do you want
the whole world to learn about relics?

03:16.880 --> 03:23.140
I'll have to do a little cleanup, 
but less than if I let you all live.

03:23.500 --> 03:26.240
Let's end this here and now.

03:26.650 --> 03:28.790
Submit to me!

03:36.890 --> 03:38.990
You foolish human.

03:40.220 --> 03:42.720
Your folly knows no bounds.

03:42.720 --> 03:45.580
Call back that power this instant!

03:45.860 --> 03:47.830
What? A crow?

03:47.830 --> 03:51.360
The vile jackal and dog lie in this place.

03:51.360 --> 03:54.050
If you do not stop, they will awaken.

03:54.400 --> 03:58.550
They'll appear right in front of me?
That saves me the trouble of finding them.

03:59.550 --> 04:03.090
<i>A jackal and a dog? Are there relics here?</i>

04:03.810 --> 04:05.250
Crow...

04:06.560 --> 04:10.310
Once I'm done with them, you're mine!

04:18.780 --> 04:20.800
You are a fool.

04:26.900 --> 04:29.670
Wh-What the hell is going on?

04:35.270 --> 04:36.810
I-It's an earthquake!

04:36.810 --> 04:37.840
Boss!

04:38.380 --> 04:39.840
<i>This is...</i>

04:41.840 --> 04:45.350
WARNING
DANGEROUS EGYPTIAN PATHOGENS 
ARE ATTEMPTING TO INVADE YOUR BODY.

04:41.840 --> 04:45.350
WARNING
YOUR RELICS ARE BEING DAMAGED BY 
THE POWER OF MULTIPLE DEATH RELICS.

04:41.840 --> 04:45.350
WARNING
RELICS WITH CATASTROPHIC POWERS
ARE APPROACHING.

05:05.490 --> 05:09.660
<i>"In January, the time will be ripe 
in the underground garden of greed."</i>

05:09.660 --> 05:14.330
<i>"The great catastrophe that plunges 
the world into chaos will begin."</i>

05:26.130 --> 05:28.430
<i>Then there's no doubt.</i>

05:29.540 --> 05:32.930
<i>This is the beginning of 
the Great Tombification.</i>

05:34.870 --> 05:38.660
Ryoga! What's going on?

05:38.660 --> 05:39.820
We're done for.

05:41.780 --> 05:45.060
We're trapped here thanks to Ogawara.

05:46.670 --> 05:50.700
Why? Nothing like this has
ever happened before...

05:50.700 --> 05:54.700
W-We're trapped? What are we gonna do?!

05:56.000 --> 05:57.980
<i>At this very moment,</i>

05:57.980 --> 06:02.720
<i>countless tombs like these are 
appearing all over the world.</i>

06:03.760 --> 06:07.220
<i>I never saw this coming.</i>

06:07.220 --> 06:09.660
Who are you?!

06:24.390 --> 06:27.390
<i>I knew it. That's the relic Set.</i>

06:28.660 --> 06:35.170
<i>In ancient Egypt, Set was the god of
deserts, darkness, destruction, and evil.</i>

06:35.900 --> 06:38.170
What is this disturbance?

06:38.630 --> 06:44.840
You pathetic humans dare disturb our rest?

06:45.660 --> 06:47.240
There's another one!

06:47.240 --> 06:49.500
No, there are two more.

06:50.260 --> 06:53.440
<i>That black Doberman is Anubis.</i>

06:53.440 --> 06:57.110
<i>And the talking neck ornament is Osiris.</i>

06:57.110 --> 07:01.610
<i>Osiris was the god of 
fertility and the afterlife.</i>

07:02.090 --> 07:05.220
<i>He always carried a crook and a flail.</i>

07:05.850 --> 07:09.130
<i>Anubis, meanwhile,
was the god of funerary rites.</i>

07:09.130 --> 07:11.660
<i>He guided the dead into the underworld.</i>

07:11.660 --> 07:15.290
<i>Three God Grade relics all at once.</i>

07:15.290 --> 07:18.170
<i>No wonder the world is 
being engulfed by tombs.</i>

07:18.690 --> 07:23.020
How can a human possess
the power to awaken us all—

07:23.020 --> 07:26.910
Sheer nonsense!
This was nothing but coincidence.

07:28.460 --> 07:30.380
What's that smell?

07:30.950 --> 07:33.930
I know that scent...

07:34.400 --> 07:36.440
Where is your dignity, Set?

07:36.710 --> 07:37.990
My dignity?

07:37.990 --> 07:41.690
You expect me to maintain dignity 
when sharing air with humans?

07:41.690 --> 07:44.150
<i>Someone's in a foul mood.</i>

07:44.450 --> 07:48.680
Only after we have killed
every last one of these worms

07:48.680 --> 07:50.160
will my anger subside.

07:50.450 --> 07:51.620
<i>Here we go!</i>

07:57.310 --> 08:02.000
Bring it on, then. And don't think 
you'll get out of this unscathed.

08:04.060 --> 08:06.990
And what do you expect to do with that?

08:06.990 --> 08:10.510
That relic is far beneath our rank.

08:10.510 --> 08:14.750
You dare look down on us, human?!

08:16.770 --> 08:19.050
An eye for an eye, a tooth for a tooth!

08:22.310 --> 08:25.780
Have a taste of your own might!

08:36.350 --> 08:39.000
Th-This can't be...

08:39.300 --> 08:43.000
That's what happens when 
you judge based on rank alone.

08:43.550 --> 08:45.500
Th-That's the crow!

08:45.880 --> 08:47.450
The crow?

08:48.010 --> 08:51.510
I smell the crow on that human.

08:51.510 --> 08:54.010
It was in that attack he just used.

08:54.010 --> 08:58.040
That traitor who sided with humans?

08:58.040 --> 09:02.400
But he was sealed away.
Is your nose playing tricks on you?

09:02.880 --> 09:06.700
How dare you?! My nose never lies!

09:06.700 --> 09:09.400
Apologize! Now! Hey! Don't you ignore me!

09:06.700 --> 09:09.400
Calm yourselves.

09:09.700 --> 09:14.410
My trial will be punishment 
enough for this prideful human.

09:16.680 --> 09:18.700
<i>Did he just say "trial"?</i>

09:25.410 --> 09:26.580
A scale?

09:30.870 --> 09:32.010
A feather...

09:32.520 --> 09:34.960
Don't tell me this scale is...

09:36.000 --> 09:38.680
How are you feeling now?

09:39.530 --> 09:44.690
This is the Scale of Judgment.
It will decide your fate.

09:47.690 --> 09:49.750
<i>I knew it.</i>

09:49.750 --> 09:53.380
<i>The Anubis relic's owner 
told me about this.</i>

09:53.380 --> 09:56.110
<i>The trial consists of questions.</i>

09:56.110 --> 09:58.080
<i>They're simple questions,</i>

09:58.080 --> 10:00.900
<i>and I just need to answer 
them all with "yes."</i>

10:01.540 --> 10:06.020
<i>You call this a trial?
What do you take me for?</i>

10:07.490 --> 10:11.670
Before the judges,
I shall ask you 42 questions.

10:12.110 --> 10:15.150
If you can answer them all
in the affirmative, you pass.

10:15.150 --> 10:19.180
But if you lie, you will pay dearly.

10:19.500 --> 10:22.180
<i>Good. It's just like what I heard.</i>

10:23.040 --> 10:24.870
The first question:

10:26.680 --> 10:30.050
Have you never stolen?

10:31.630 --> 10:34.950
<i>I-I sure have! Lots of times, in fact!</i>

10:37.120 --> 10:38.850
You cannot answer?

10:38.850 --> 10:40.450
Hold it! I'm still thinking!

10:40.720 --> 10:42.340
Next question, then:

10:42.340 --> 10:44.960
Have you never told a lie?

10:45.310 --> 10:48.870
<i>Damn it! What kind
of questions are these?!</i>

10:49.880 --> 10:52.960
Have you never hit someone?

10:52.960 --> 10:54.530
<i>Damn it…</i>

10:54.530 --> 10:57.470
<i>They're definitely 
simple questions, but...</i>

10:59.610 --> 11:01.720
You just have to answer yes.

11:01.720 --> 11:05.300
I forgot the exact questions, 
but they were really easy.

11:06.900 --> 11:10.110
<i>For a child who had
yet to commit any sins,</i>

11:10.110 --> 11:12.230
<i>of course this trial
would be easy to pass.</i>

11:12.230 --> 11:16.550
Judgment! There is no need 
to ask further questions!

11:16.550 --> 11:18.740
All humans are sinful!

11:20.280 --> 11:22.260
Judgment has been passed.

11:22.260 --> 11:24.920
Make yourself comfortable in hell.

11:24.920 --> 11:26.250
Wait a second!

11:44.080 --> 11:46.040
I'm... alive?

11:46.730 --> 11:48.600
But where am I?

11:58.050 --> 11:59.490
For crying out loud...

11:59.860 --> 12:03.490
A whole horde of zombies?
What the hell is going on?!

12:03.790 --> 12:06.030
You want me to suffer before I die?!

12:30.230 --> 12:34.660
I can't go out as dinner 
for a bunch of zombies!

12:38.360 --> 12:41.170
You seem to be struggling.

12:41.740 --> 12:47.460
It's been a while since I last aided you 
in person. Be grateful, Goriki Ryoga!

12:53.960 --> 12:55.790
B-Boss...

12:56.790 --> 13:00.050
<i>What in the world is going on in there?</i>

13:00.430 --> 13:03.030
Why is this taking so long?!

13:04.170 --> 13:06.060
Hm? Wait...

13:07.800 --> 13:09.060
What's happening?

13:09.060 --> 13:12.710
The Sphere of Judgment is cracking!

13:12.710 --> 13:16.070
I've never seen anything 
like this. Can it be...

13:20.800 --> 13:23.870
H-How is that possible?!

13:36.440 --> 13:39.750
How can a mere human 
be capable of such a thing?

13:39.750 --> 13:41.970
W-Wait! That's...

13:42.540 --> 13:44.470
Th-The crow!

13:44.470 --> 13:49.570
I knew you were behind this!
Have you no shame, you traitor?!

13:49.570 --> 13:52.520
Anubis! What is this? What happened?

13:52.520 --> 13:56.210
Isn't it obvious?
The crow overpowered him!

13:56.210 --> 13:59.750
You were sealed! How are you here?!

13:59.750 --> 14:02.600
We haven't forgotten how you, 
alongside humans,

14:02.600 --> 14:06.070
attacked our kind and stole 
their powers for yourself!

14:06.350 --> 14:09.000
Ripping you limb from limb 
would be too lenient!

14:09.000 --> 14:10.820
Is what he's saying true?

14:14.670 --> 14:20.840
Damn it. Then I'll wipe 
you all out at once!

14:27.600 --> 14:30.940
Rampage as you please!

14:30.940 --> 14:34.470
Try and fight your way 
out of this, humans!

14:44.950 --> 14:48.190
Even I can do nothing more here, human.

14:48.190 --> 14:50.950
I wasn't expecting you to.

14:50.950 --> 14:54.210
Oh? Why do you seem so calm?

14:54.210 --> 14:56.480
The situation is completely different.

14:59.800 --> 15:04.120
Here, I can use my powers to the fullest!

15:06.470 --> 15:08.720
You certainly are amusing.

15:36.470 --> 15:39.450
This human has grown full of himself.

15:39.450 --> 15:41.680
Hmph. All in vain.

15:41.680 --> 15:44.580
Our army of the dead is infinite.

15:56.560 --> 15:57.860
<i>There's no end to them.</i>

15:57.860 --> 15:59.940
<i>I need to find their true bodies.</i>

16:00.560 --> 16:02.830
Okay, you're up.

16:03.760 --> 16:05.250
Where am I?

16:05.250 --> 16:07.770
It feels like home.

16:07.770 --> 16:10.420
Egyptian Funeral Knife,

16:10.420 --> 16:13.790
can you sense the energy of your homeland?

16:13.790 --> 16:18.290
Master Anubis is close by! What power!

16:18.520 --> 16:23.330
Can you show me where he is, then?

16:23.330 --> 16:25.050
Let's pay him our respects.

16:25.480 --> 16:27.300
A splendid idea.

16:27.640 --> 16:29.800
Then let's go.

16:51.200 --> 16:52.820
What's going on here?

16:53.410 --> 16:56.410
Ah, you've come to, Anubis.

16:56.850 --> 16:59.470
Did you two use your powers?

16:59.470 --> 17:01.770
Yes. We had no choice.

17:01.770 --> 17:04.440
That relic-eating crow appeared.

17:04.440 --> 17:07.710
Truly? The crow that was sealed?

17:13.850 --> 17:15.950
Now is not the time!

17:15.950 --> 17:18.190
We have to warn the other—

17:18.190 --> 17:19.930
Found you!

17:23.200 --> 17:25.610
H-How did he...

17:26.110 --> 17:27.270
Impossib—

17:29.080 --> 17:30.280
Master Osiris!

17:36.820 --> 17:39.740
H-How can this be?

17:41.790 --> 17:43.230
Judgment.

17:47.170 --> 17:49.670
Now shut up and listen.

17:49.670 --> 17:51.850
The judgment from earlier is void.

17:51.850 --> 17:54.680
We're starting over, got it?

17:55.260 --> 17:56.540
Do not speak nonsense!

17:56.540 --> 17:59.410
You will not pass either way!

17:59.410 --> 18:02.520
Oh, yes, I will. I can promise you that.

18:12.420 --> 18:14.570
Very well. The first question—

18:17.350 --> 18:20.960
You'll ask the questions
exactly as I tell you.

18:21.250 --> 18:23.960
Question 1: "Have you ever stolen?"

18:23.960 --> 18:27.160
What?! I will not ask that!

18:27.160 --> 18:28.740
Do not joke about—

18:28.740 --> 18:30.920
"Have you ever stolen?"

18:48.000 --> 18:50.860
Have you... ever stolen?

18:51.880 --> 18:54.240
What? I can't hear you.

18:54.580 --> 18:57.260
Have you ever stolen, you worm?!

19:00.810 --> 19:02.750
Watch your language.

19:02.750 --> 19:06.540
Ask again, and show 
some respect this time.

19:09.670 --> 19:13.830
H-Have you ever stolen, my lord?

19:14.260 --> 19:16.490
Yes, I have.

19:16.490 --> 19:19.020
Good. Next question...

19:19.650 --> 19:21.880
Hmm... What should we use?

19:21.880 --> 19:25.940
You want to make me ask all 
42 questions this way, you—

19:30.020 --> 19:33.030
I mean... do you, my lord?

19:35.480 --> 19:37.540
What's happening now?!

19:45.540 --> 19:47.520
What in the world...

19:50.320 --> 19:51.670
What's going on?

19:51.670 --> 19:55.800
Did Goriki actually
seize the relics for himself?

20:09.690 --> 20:10.730
YOU HAVE SUCCESSFULLY SUBJUGATED
THE EGYPTIAN GOD GRADE RELICS.
YOUR DOMINANCE OVER EGYPTIAN RELICS HAS INCREASED.

20:10.730 --> 20:13.530
YOUR RESISTANCE TO DEATH RELICS
HAS INCREASED THANKS TO THE RELIC OF ANUBIS.

20:13.530 --> 20:14.690
YOUR SKILL "TOLERANCE"
HAS RISEN TO RANK C.

20:14.690 --> 20:17.550
That's a lot of pop-ups.

20:18.700 --> 20:21.200
[EXPLORER OF THE GREAT TOMB]
YOU HAVE OBTAINED A NEW TITLE.
YOUR SKILL "EXCAVATION" HAS RISEN TO RANK E.

20:18.700 --> 20:21.200
[DECEITFUL TOMB RAIDER]
YOU HAVE OBTAINED A NEW TITLE.
YOUR AFFINITY HAS SLIGHTLY DECREASED.
YOUR TOMB RAIDER TRAITS HAVE IMPROVED.

20:20.760 --> 20:23.670
What am I supposed to 
use titles like that for?

20:24.890 --> 20:27.120
Damn that crow.

20:27.120 --> 20:28.400
Hey, you.

20:31.530 --> 20:34.360
It seems I underestimated your abilities.

20:34.360 --> 20:37.200
Please excuse my behavior.

20:37.610 --> 20:39.380
Let me make you an offer.

20:39.380 --> 20:42.390
Why don't we work together?

20:45.850 --> 20:50.180
As I'm sure you know, 
this world is about to change.

20:50.180 --> 20:53.580
That makes capable people 
like you all the more valuable.

20:54.320 --> 20:59.450
As chairman of TKBM, 
I can guarantee you any form of support.

21:02.200 --> 21:04.450
Work for me.
